sequenceDiagram
  participant B as Browser SDK
  participant A as Supabase Auth / Discord
  participant L as Lambda API
  B->>A: Discord OAuth with PKCE
  A-->>B: Redirect to /auth/callback with code
  B->>A: Exchange code
  A-->>B: Access, refresh and provider tokens
  B->>L: POST /api/users/me (bearer, optional provider token)
  L->>A: Verify JWT and provisioning identity
  L-->>B: Current league account and database roles
